The distributed plugin is not only this repository's source. `main.js` and
`styles.css` embed a complete TeX engine, a set of TeX packages and a set of
fonts, all of which carry their own terms. The list below is what is actually
inside the files you install, with the licence each part is redistributed under.
Full texts are in vendor/LICENSES/.

The plugin as a whole is GPL-3.0-or-later because the engine it embeds is.


ENGINE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

